@host = http://localhost:5193

### Search concepts by name
GET {{host}}/api/concepts?term=diabetes
Accept: application/json

### Search concepts by identifier case 2 (cauliflower ear)
GET {{host}}/api/concepts?term=28072004
Accept: application/json

###

### Search for hypertension
GET {{host}}/api/concepts?term=hypertension
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a concept by identifier
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/73211009
Accept: application/json

###

### A concept identifier with no active match returns 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/999999999
Accept: application/json

###

### A missing term returns 400 Bad Request
GET {{host}}/api/concepts
Accept: application/json

###
